🕹️ Unknown Entity
“The clock is ticking. Do you trust your gut?”

🧠 About the Game
Unknown Entity is a minimalist timing challenge where precision meets pressure. The goal is simple: stop the timer just before it hits zero. Sounds easy? Try it across multiple difficulties — from 1 second to 15 — and discover how tricky your internal clock can be.

🎯 How to Play
Choose a difficulty:

Easy – 1 second

Medium – 5 seconds

Hard – 10 seconds

Expert – 15 seconds

Start the challenge — the countdown begins silently.

Tap Stop when you think the time is (almost) up.

Your score is how close you were to zero — too early or too late, and you lose.

🚀 Tech Stack
React

JavaScript

CSS

💡 Inspiration
A fun twist on reaction games — no numbers, no timers, just your instincts.